{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't tick him off.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Game Background]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/background_story.gif?t=1739426369\" />It is a side-scrolling run-and-gun action game set in the future. The main character, Kevin, who lost everything and was reborn as a cyborg, begins to take revenge on Golida, an alien who took everything from him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Synopsis]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/game_synopsis.gif?t=1739426369\" />In 4373. Kevin was once hailed as a war hero.  Now an old and sick veteran, he is living a peaceful old age on a nursing spaceship with his beloved dog 'Andy'. Until the nursing spaceship exploded due to an invasion by the alien &quot;Golida&quot;, losing his beloved dog 'Andy' and most of his body.....</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Find combat suits and feel the intense battles]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/battle.gif?t=1739426369\" />You have to defeat all the invaders \u2018Golida\u2019 using a variety of combat suits. It's time to start to take bloody revenge on the alien 'Golida' using the various combat suits that can be discovered during the game and the various features provided by each combat suit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Explore the diverse planets of Helios]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/helios_system.png?t=1739426369\" />About 130 years ago, Earthlings left solar system and migrated to the Helios system. Explore the nine mysterious planets of the Helios system and uncover the secrets of Helios. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Discover the hidden secrets]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093800/extras/secret.gif?t=1739426369\" />Discover the secrets hidden on the nine planets of Helios. You'll find a variety of collectibles and stories to tell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Join our Communities]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We believe that a great game will be made with communities.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please share your opinions, ideas, feedback, and questions. Share your awesome wins, suggest innovative features, or point out bugs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We always listen to the community on Discord, X, Facebook, ETC.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No Space for Old Men","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2093800/c52fa028afbe0a2f953840f61e3187422401b004.jpg"},{"name":"The Birth of Cyborg Kevin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2093800/10c36d7e16096b0067dcd9aa1c587d9fd745d1d0.jpg"},{"name":"No Pain, No Gain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2093800/2c37445923afdc441cd6bb81fb7dbaf26c2afc2d.jpg"},{"name":"Kevin, The Beginning of Counterattack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2093800/44b0a228e918483fbd60640548e16b61efcef60e.jpg"},{"name":"Clear on Normal Difficulty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2093800/1607be38f413908bb4d0a05b11533b7c47df9f91.jpg"},{"name":"Clear on Hard Difficulty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2093800/a4846e1617e7060011138886f93374aad8879e84.jpg"},{"name":"Clear on Hell Difficulty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2093800/c45183acbb8b545d829117a600d6f087bbcfa46